{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p38493-65ff0771698dbe1781dc","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"오랜만이구나, 내가 곧 {RUBY_B#살짝 보게}눈길을 주게{RUBY_E#} 될 사도여","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7983007418516420577"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-3f82063bf2af4f32d4b4","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"좋은 소식을 알려주러 왔다냥——","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11481325843155560024"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-819e446fd5e98d5650c9","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"축하해, 나와 녀석들의 인정을 받아 야옹야옹 「개척」 운명의 길의 사도가 됐어!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7767361781480889269"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-6a0a30982a8e44f046b0","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"앗싸, 내가 사도가 됐다냥!","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14089180807389719724"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-4f49a29e2c4cd8704f0d","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"정말 감동이야. 말하는 것까지 완전히 동화됐다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["539213579657265596"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-d06deb96cbf67d4e48d8","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"그럼 포상을 확인해 볼까?","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10144557836994682280"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-cffcb2b1cf5f3ee1a38d","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"좋아! 이건 네가 마땅히 받아야 할 보상이다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3501646631622774118"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-d911fcc9b03850529670","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"얼굴 한번 보기 참 힘드네","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14136242799139844172"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-8b1b73d542475c4fffd8","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"야옹? 지금 뭘 한다고 생각하는 거야? 넌 지금 에이언즈를 알현하고 있는 거다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10438527050942799248"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-f992822bbfd9319040cb","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"너와 네 동료들, 그리고 우주를 누비는 이 열차는 역시 내 예상대로 녀석들을 진정으로 보호하고, 녀석들에게 간식과 따뜻함을 나눠줄 수 있는 곳이더군","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18134304813780442824"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-a352b5ecf3940008cb49","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"이 야옹님은 정말 고마워하고 있어! 그래서 내가 정말 정성을 다해 이 선물을 준비했다냥~","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10637464976875503108"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-29e4f14602142c2a4e95","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"냥키비리는 동글동글한 앞발을 이용해, 정교하게 다듬어진 캣타워 하나를 꺼냈다","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["14764448222189286346"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-5ef5636028e51c84b33f","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"하지만 그 가장자리에는 여전히 수공예로 제작된 흔적이 선명하게 보인다…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["9937650355513923406"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-57955a2ef74b384636bd","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"네가… 직접 만든 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["3028109344634225489"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-e485265dedc720d0f5cf","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"저… 절대 아니거든!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4602834207861524847"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-4660c8293322edb9b7cd","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"에이언즈는 생각만으로도 물건을 창조할 수 있어. 직접 만들 필요가 없다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2149782305842188062"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-eda555a5c5bc712cf7b9","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"새로운 캣타워잖아!","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["4729877136145174776"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-da4efbccac59fa468c22","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"마, 마음에 안 들어?","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1693077898279633345"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-cf584d6fece20c845962","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"녀석들이 평소엔 뛰어다니며 놀다가, 가끔은 너무 신나서 집안을 엉망으로 만들기도 하잖아……","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14331380830074089297"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-d94b28699da08cf0c033","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"그래서, 내가 이 선물을 준비했어. 녀석들이 얌전히 위에 있으면서 네 집을 더 예쁘게 만들어주길 바랄게!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4638254819665278942"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-9c631cc07ae1d29d2c5e","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"냥~ 세계를 구하는 것에 비하면, 지금 네가 하고 있는 일이 얼마나 대단한지 실감이 안 날 수도 있지!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13292632886519250851"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-83d9a4704b1f9f44cea6","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"하지만 나와 녀석들 눈에는, 네가 엄청 멋있다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7775867159680814122"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-6db071dce57321b803c9","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sc3c7add2172ba3f8","text":"정말 부럽… 아니 그러니까, 나를 따라서 야옹야옹 「개척」의 길을 걷다니, 녀석들 정말 행복하겠구나!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 3","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18205102739379011100"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p38493","title":"「